{"type": "header", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "load_s": 1.274, "peak_rss_mb": 506.3, "num_sentences": 30, "decode_params": {"model": "k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx tts-models/kokoro-int8-multi-lang-v1_1.tar.bz2", "model_file": "model.int8.onnx", "lexicons": ["lexicon-us-en.txt", "lexicon-zh.txt"], "rule_fsts": ["date-zh.fst", "phone-zh.fst", "number-zh.fst"], "sid": 4, "speaker": "zf_002", "speed": 1.0, "num_threads": 4}}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s001", "text": "你好，今天的会议改到下午3点半开始。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.035, "n_samples": 96844, "proc_s": 4.9609, "rtf": 1.2294, "samples_sha256": "d4ce28fa4d30f32577fe49bd3493deb26c4986b741b78204a476e77c56b68a06"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s002", "text": "我刚买了一部新的iPhone，用起来很顺手。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.984, "n_samples": 119620, "proc_s": 6.3613, "rtf": 1.2763, "samples_sha256": "f3ae4395e3f0e343b28682fedf0b079973da649ff41e7853c414613cdef2ab5e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s003", "text": "这件衣服打折以后只要128元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.785, "n_samples": 90831, "proc_s": 4.3956, "rtf": 1.1614, "samples_sha256": "6546530a576ac02f85684682c5596006467ddca13886e312e36dac0641b23b3b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s004", "text": "我们约在2026年10月20日见面吧。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.57, "n_samples": 85675, "proc_s": 4.6215, "rtf": 1.2946, "samples_sha256": "efd474474a1cdaeabc25e1f116a45ff14556f38fe282ab82c876b195689b56fd"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s005", "text": "请把报告在周五之前发给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.005, "n_samples": 72113, "proc_s": 3.7826, "rtf": 1.2589, "samples_sha256": "a0feebe2b5b76661ac515d4ee5edf9111859b8e740461ba25050d45b189e2772"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s006", "text": "现在的AI工具越来越好用了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.954, "n_samples": 94907, "proc_s": 5.2739, "rtf": 1.3336, "samples_sha256": "aac41328c39bb7adb59e97ada10307a132814edc8a691fc85a94259a6939f430"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s007", "text": "你的航班几点起飞？我记得是早上8点20分。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 5.085, "n_samples": 122033, "proc_s": 6.5774, "rtf": 1.2936, "samples_sha256": "5e782dd93778612e2b8afcfbee1aad19994f2906bbd0e0b4d625ca78601876cf"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s008", "text": "这个月的电费一共是356块钱。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.867, "n_samples": 92797, "proc_s": 4.8584, "rtf": 1.2565, "samples_sha256": "e899df4d6e2b1a456fb9eb792b13ef45200e481fd586642ef48d2866ed473573"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s009", "text": "我住在3楼，电梯就在门口右边。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.929, "n_samples": 94290, "proc_s": 5.3572, "rtf": 1.3636, "samples_sha256": "0c7fd139a29f26e1082e4d873e1635cca261711cbf04252e7af72a3420920915"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s010", "text": "他每天跑步5公里，已经坚持了两年。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.14, "n_samples": 99366, "proc_s": 5.2301, "rtf": 1.2632, "samples_sha256": "599d285f4153f1c7444d821cc5300ba4de66d4afe8ceab95fed25c87b252cc4e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s011", "text": "下周一我们要去上海出差。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.857, "n_samples": 68561, "proc_s": 3.6104, "rtf": 1.2638, "samples_sha256": "e3f905e354915f015fe97ad66f343271a27fe9c6c1d7fbeafdf78a32836095cf"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s012", "text": "你能帮我订一张明天去北京的高铁票吗？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.953, "n_samples": 94878, "proc_s": 5.0447, "rtf": 1.2761, "samples_sha256": "b6d78fb498cd7d34f51cd47e037b612ef8b2b6c7e263d3735017d13d64fa75a7"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s013", "text": "这家餐厅的评分是4.8分，值得一试。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.404, "n_samples": 105691, "proc_s": 5.8173, "rtf": 1.321, "samples_sha256": "c8fc025e14624be6cc704ac3ffafd7b055cf9c688e86acb8865e4cab85c1af2d"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s014", "text": "我的手机号是13812345678，有事打给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 5.254, "n_samples": 126104, "proc_s": 6.7951, "rtf": 1.2932, "samples_sha256": "66c9b62eec6d440950ad485532198452dba118f90bece29d26899054b9b59bc1"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s015", "text": "今年公司的销售额增长了15%。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.422, "n_samples": 82131, "proc_s": 4.176, "rtf": 1.2203, "samples_sha256": "3915f0e0dee1626d01ef476504ad5f16cb43aa2a6d19772dbb5f9b7f7367b7bf"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s016", "text": "孩子们放学以后在公园里踢足球。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.503, "n_samples": 84083, "proc_s": 4.3064, "rtf": 1.2292, "samples_sha256": "1c27e2445f10bb3f2823b21be3c0bb2c5d07f9dfdd72d1423b027fb0acf76bfc"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s017", "text": "我用微信给你转了2000块，记得查收。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.994, "n_samples": 95851, "proc_s": 5.3756, "rtf": 1.346, "samples_sha256": "0d82ea2f492fb2bb49a0390210d686885db95d783a70c05fb8ea7c4b2ed0bb0b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s018", "text": "天气预报说明天最高气温32度。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.784, "n_samples": 90806, "proc_s": 4.4984, "rtf": 1.1889, "samples_sha256": "838d680e9c4083e252955506fdf78922fda7b2369aa279666cf93164182d6448"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s019", "text": "请问洗手间在哪里？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.342, "n_samples": 56213, "proc_s": 2.8434, "rtf": 1.214, "samples_sha256": "f794d9186e9217d8527883721a132d73894ed834d364c72fcc13a3db5ad6a853"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s020", "text": "我们的Zoom会议链接已经发到群里了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.06, "n_samples": 97444, "proc_s": 5.2701, "rtf": 1.298, "samples_sha256": "0279d1b2fe01329f83766e300ee5d2797091cc6f41f68263679f6ebacfc49222"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s021", "text": "这本书我看了一半，故事特别精彩。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.161, "n_samples": 99867, "proc_s": 5.0893, "rtf": 1.2231, "samples_sha256": "33905f1e4ec42a3cfbbb2daeee85fd80555f896be5f262adcbc711202d06c91b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s022", "text": "他的生日是5月4日，我们准备给他一个惊喜。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.993, "n_samples": 119830, "proc_s": 6.013, "rtf": 1.2043, "samples_sha256": "6d62095ef37efc57a2a57f0d0d4b56b982ef86a446bec4795ceea1e6f0359a32"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s023", "text": "从这里打车到机场大概需要40分钟。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.002, "n_samples": 96057, "proc_s": 4.7944, "rtf": 1.1979, "samples_sha256": "6ef892099c011c3b646a4072b6ca432d0447742af448ec51cfb28f2589b5757b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s024", "text": "我刚下载了ChatGPT的新版本。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.319, "n_samples": 103655, "proc_s": 5.6504, "rtf": 1.3083, "samples_sha256": "a13f1a00d3cd040dc04d401d6db83e143fd897b91e2a5ab657cd34e3d1126b97"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s025", "text": "房租每个月涨了500元，真让人头疼。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.237, "n_samples": 101689, "proc_s": 5.6165, "rtf": 1.3256, "samples_sha256": "4bf87674a4fc4b4b2070fc1ede388dc16dc78204f2d54887e75be52c76dbb081"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s026", "text": "周末你想去看电影还是去爬山？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.486, "n_samples": 83665, "proc_s": 4.2078, "rtf": 1.207, "samples_sha256": "534be516c7ec9e212eae7c9db18d2156ae8954caa3049258ecde775d14c236a5"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s027", "text": "这台笔记本电脑的价格是6999元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.699, "n_samples": 112776, "proc_s": 5.4698, "rtf": 1.164, "samples_sha256": "93270ed52f6cc533cdd4e6fa347f91a595ac675de610d01938ec5d9c31146f6d"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s028", "text": "医生建议我每天喝8杯水。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.98, "n_samples": 71515, "proc_s": 3.6526, "rtf": 1.2258, "samples_sha256": "228e17e70b15a1dabcb1efd0dfdf198a2ca6bf99a919dea418f8d1fc27c6e73b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s029", "text": "我们团队一共有12个人，分成3个小组。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.445, "n_samples": 106677, "proc_s": 5.5908, "rtf": 1.2578, "samples_sha256": "edce8a6dd7b40b328e72d3a1900d587b81babf7bfd35dd496b277c28540d769a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid4", "sentence_id": "s030", "text": "谢谢你的帮忙，下次我请你喝咖啡。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.979, "n_samples": 95491, "proc_s": 4.9565, "rtf": 1.2457, "samples_sha256": "8f37f10ca0c30f38c91eb9cda20802553cf69947ff4303a4d1926c949976fc8d"}
